        "Content": "Property Features\r\n•\tExceptional A1-rated family residence \r\n•\tApproximately 254 square metres with a versatile attic of approximately 30 square metres with its own En-suite Bathroom\r\n•\tSeparate detached garden office of approximately 43 sq.m. \r\n•\tSite extending to approximately 0.22 acres \r\n•\tFour bedrooms, including an approximately 54 sq.m. principal suite \r\n•\tAdditional attic living accommodation with shower room \r\n•\tBespoke joinery throughout \r\n•\tTriple-glazed Nordan windows and doors \r\n•\tViessmann air-to-water heat pump \r\n•\tUnderfloor heating across the ground and concrete first floors \r\n•\tBrink MVHR system serving all three floors \r\n•\t10kW solar photovoltaic system with 20kWh battery storage \r\n•\tIntegrated sound system serving most rooms \r\n•\tEngineered timber flooring throughout\r\n•\tVilleroy & Boch sanitary ware\r\n•\tPrivate Entrance with Electric Gates\r\n•\tExternal CCTV security system\r\n•\tMature landscaped gardens with Philips Hue smart outdoor lighting system\r\n•\tDesigned by the award-winning Arc Design, with award-winning interior design by Cohn Design.\r\n•\tFeatured in Selfbuild Magazine in May 2025"
